> Data Engineering System Design Patterns (Interview Order)
 1 . Batch ETL / ELT Pipeline Design

Interview Question:
Design a batch ETL pipeline to load data from SQL Server into Snowflake every night.

Step 1: Clarify Requirements (Always start here)
Before drawing the architecture, ask:

What is the data source? (SQL Server)
Batch or real-time? (Batch)
Frequency? (Daily at 2 AM)
Data volume? (Example: 100 GB/day)
Full load or incremental? (Incremental)
SLA? (Pipeline should finish by 6 AM)
Reporting destination? (Snowflake)








